<title>USA: Global Village extends credit line.</title>
<headline>Global Village extends credit line.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global Village Communication Inc on Monday said it renegotiated a financing agreement with Bank of the West, retaining its current line of credit through August 15.</p>
<p>The outstanding balance on the credit line is $4.2 million, which is the maximum commitment allowed under the renegotiated agreement.</p>
<p>The company, which makes communications products for Apple Macintosh personal computers, said it was still pursuing fresh sources of financing.</p>
</text>
